    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Train!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Megalotrain</strong> is a top-down adventure game where you explore the cars of a magical train, collecting items, battling enemies, and unraveling secrets to find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/81cc9908f0984dae91ace1d6cf7e1e35.poster.avif?t=1750810086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/81cc9908f0984dae91ace1d6cf7e1e35.webm?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/81cc9908f0984dae91ace1d6cf7e1e35.mp4?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>roll</strong> to dodge enemies and projectiles, and organize your weapons wisely to assemble your favorite set and progress through this adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/8ddf7c64cf00767a1c3d9cee1a362feb.poster.avif?t=1750810086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/8ddf7c64cf00767a1c3d9cee1a362feb.webm?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/8ddf7c64cf00767a1c3d9cee1a362feb.mp4?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons and Items!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To face this train and its dangers, you'll need a good way to defend yourself! Choose from various types of weapons, including <strong>melee weapons</strong> for those who want to face danger head-on and engage in close combat, or <strong>ranged weapons</strong> for those who prefer a strategic approach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on <strong>special items</strong>, such as those that can <strong>stop time</strong>, <strong>summon cannons</strong> to aid you in battle, or even <strong>teleport you</strong> away from danger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/80bd5b14fcca9258fdec5790e94901c3.poster.avif?t=1750810086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/80bd5b14fcca9258fdec5790e94901c3.webm?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/80bd5b14fcca9258fdec5790e94901c3.mp4?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bosses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of bosses in this game! A socialite who hosts a children's show and is secretly a vampire, or an evil emperor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/59181fa238bacf07852028bccbd5ac45.poster.avif?t=1750810086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/59181fa238bacf07852028bccbd5ac45.webm?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/59181fa238bacf07852028bccbd5ac45.mp4?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Allies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet allies like a friendly little witch named Clowth, or even a humanoid garlic named Norbs! They will help you in this battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/2d139a804488257970b848d15307f842.poster.avif?t=1750810086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/2d139a804488257970b848d15307f842.webm?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/2d139a804488257970b848d15307f842.mp4?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxation is Necessary!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing is also fun! Fish and try your luck to collect various items and the rarest fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/519b942a6ca6826f98f18b17b3ce268c.poster.avif?t=1750810086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/519b942a6ca6826f98f18b17b3ce268c.webm?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/519b942a6ca6826f98f18b17b3ce268c.mp4?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story and Characters!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fun story and encounter a variety of characters in this adventure, complete with several <strong>cutscenes</strong> in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/7ddaf6e3a2e1580111f8637dec820ff5.poster.avif?t=1750810086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/7ddaf6e3a2e1580111f8637dec820ff5.webm?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/7ddaf6e3a2e1580111f8637dec820ff5.mp4?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Unusual Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on unexpected moments in the game, from skiing down a mountain to battling a giant duck in a spaceship showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/caa857cc852b2af2b191aa4e9f62a57d.poster.avif?t=1750810086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/caa857cc852b2af2b191aa4e9f62a57d.webm?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701190/extras/caa857cc852b2af2b191aa4e9f62a57d.mp4?t=1750810086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
